        "created_at": "2019-03-19T02:32:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You can do screen recordings directly on the iPad as of iOS 11. Or you can record it using QuickTime Player on Mac (I use this functionality when I'm live streaming from iPad/iPhone).</p>",
