      {
        "id": 225975,
        "name": "bluedarky",
        "username": "bluedarky",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2019-03-20T11:17:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;I was going to say most of my YouTube channel is recordings of sentinels from iPad directly, if you’re on iOS 11 follow the instructions below.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1. Go to settings, control center, customise controls and make sure Screen Recording is included.</p>\n<p>2. Swipe down from the upper right of the screen (where the power indicator is)</p>\n<p>3. Press the record button.</p>\n<p>4. When you finish repeat steps two and three to stop recording.</p>\n<p>5. Your new video should shortly be under photos and can be transferred to a pc or Mac like any other photo.</p>",
        "post_number": 24,
